RE: Request for Location Data Deletion and Opt-Out of GPS Tracking

Dear Privacy Officer,

I am writing to formally request the deletion of my location data and to opt out of all location tracking services. My account details are:

Account Username/Email: {{account_email}}
Account ID (if known): {{account_id}}
Device ID (if applicable): {{device_id}}

Please send your response to:
Email: {{your_email}}
Mail: {{your_address}}

If I do not receive confirmation within 30 days, I will file complaints with relevant privacy authorities and may pursue additional legal remedies.

I also request that you provide information about how I can prevent future location tracking through your services or apps.

Thank you for your prompt attention to this privacy request.

Sincerely,
{{your_signature}}
{{your_name}}

Date: {{date}}
